WEBVTT

00:00.960 --> 00:02.000
Matthew 12

00:02.000 --> 00:06.500
At that time Jesus went through the grain fields on the Sabbath.

00:07.260 --> 00:11.480
His disciples were hungry, and they began to pluck heads of grain and to eat.

00:12.020 --> 00:14.760
But when the Pharisees saw it, they said to him,

00:15.480 --> 00:20.020
Look, your disciples are doing what is not lawful to do on the Sabbath.

00:20.860 --> 00:22.000
He said to them,

00:22.580 --> 00:27.140
Have you not read what David did when he was hungry and those who were with him?

00:27.140 --> 00:31.000
How he entered the house of God and ate the bread of the presence,

00:31.560 --> 00:36.720
which it is not lawful for him to eat, nor for those who were with him, but only for the priests.

00:37.600 --> 00:44.560
Or, have you not read in the law how on the Sabbath the priests in the temple profane the Sabbath and are guiltless?

00:45.180 --> 00:48.360
I tell you, something greater than the temple is here.

00:48.940 --> 00:54.060
And if you had known what this means, I desire mercy and not sacrifice,

00:54.400 --> 00:57.080
you would not have condemned the guiltless.

00:57.480 --> 01:00.160
For the Son of Man is Lord of the Sabbath.

01:01.480 --> 01:03.940
He went on from there and entered their synagogue.

01:04.680 --> 01:06.740
And a man was there with a withered hand.

01:07.240 --> 01:08.440
And they asked him,

01:08.840 --> 01:10.700
Is it lawful to heal on the Sabbath?

01:11.440 --> 01:13.040
So that they might accuse him.

01:13.680 --> 01:14.940
He said to them,

01:15.480 --> 01:20.080
Which one of you who has a sheep, if it falls into a pit on the Sabbath,

01:20.560 --> 01:22.660
will not take hold of it and lift it out?

01:23.380 --> 01:26.620
Of how much more value is a man than a sheep?

01:27.140 --> 01:29.880
So it is lawful to do good on the Sabbath.

01:30.940 --> 01:32.440
Then he said to the man,

01:33.300 --> 01:34.820
Stretch out your hand.

01:35.340 --> 01:41.180
And the man stretched it out, and it was restored, healthy like the other.

01:41.680 --> 01:46.380
But the Pharisees went out and conspired against him how to destroy him.

01:47.120 --> 01:50.140
Jesus, aware of this, withdrew from there.

01:50.640 --> 01:55.700
And many followed him, and he healed them all, and ordered them not to make him known.

01:56.800 --> 01:57.120
This,

01:57.140 --> 02:00.440
was to fulfill what was spoken by the prophet Isaiah.

02:01.480 --> 02:04.160
Behold my servant, whom I have chosen,

02:04.540 --> 02:07.220
my beloved with whom my soul is well pleased.

02:07.480 --> 02:09.660
I will put my spirit upon him,

02:10.020 --> 02:12.460
and he will proclaim justice to the Gentiles.

02:13.140 --> 02:15.400
He will not quarrel or cry aloud,

02:15.820 --> 02:18.120
nor will anyone hear his voice in the streets.

02:18.780 --> 02:20.640
A bruised reed he will not break,

02:20.920 --> 02:22.940
and a smoldering wick he will not quench,

02:23.240 --> 02:25.100
until he brings justice to victory.

02:25.300 --> 02:26.860
And in his name,

02:27.140 --> 02:28.640
the Gentiles will hope.

02:29.300 --> 02:33.680
Then a demon-oppressed man who was blind and mute was brought to him,

02:33.840 --> 02:36.980
and he healed him, so that the man spoke and saw.

02:37.560 --> 02:40.260
And all the people were amazed and said,

02:40.900 --> 02:42.520
Can this be the son of David?

02:43.220 --> 02:46.020
But when the Pharisees heard it, they said,

02:46.720 --> 02:52.140
It is only by Beelzebul, the prince of demons, that this man casts out demons.

02:52.800 --> 02:56.140
Knowing their thoughts, he said to them,

02:56.140 --> 02:59.800
Every kingdom divided against itself is laid waste,

03:00.300 --> 03:03.340
and no city or house divided against itself will stand.

03:04.040 --> 03:08.280
And if Satan casts out Satan, he is divided against himself.

03:08.920 --> 03:10.820
How then will his kingdom stand?

03:11.420 --> 03:13.860
And if I cast out demons by Beelzebul,

03:14.220 --> 03:16.560
by whom do your sons cast them out?

03:17.060 --> 03:18.980
Therefore they will be your judges.

03:19.700 --> 03:22.620
But if it is by the Spirit of God that I cast out demons,

03:22.620 --> 03:25.920
then the kingdom of God has come upon you.

03:26.140 --> 03:30.940
Or how can someone enter a strong man's house and plunder his goods,

03:31.400 --> 03:33.500
unless he first binds the strong man?

03:33.900 --> 03:36.060
Then indeed he may plunder his house.

03:36.820 --> 03:39.280
Whoever is not with me is against me,

03:39.420 --> 03:42.000
and whoever does not gather with me scatters.

03:42.580 --> 03:43.600
Therefore I tell you,

03:44.020 --> 03:46.660
every sin and blasphemy will be forgiven people,

03:47.000 --> 03:50.100
but the blasphemy against the Spirit will not be forgiven.

03:50.100 --> 03:54.020
And whoever speaks a word against the Son of Man will be forgiven,

03:54.660 --> 03:56.120
but whoever speaks against the Holy Spirit,

03:56.140 --> 03:58.140
will not be forgiven,

03:58.140 --> 04:01.140
either in this age or in the age to come.

04:03.140 --> 04:06.140
Either make the tree good and its fruit good,

04:06.140 --> 04:08.140
or make the tree bad and its fruit bad,

04:08.140 --> 04:11.140
for the tree is known by its fruit.

04:11.140 --> 04:13.140
You brood of vipers,

04:13.140 --> 04:16.140
how can you speak good when you are evil?

04:16.140 --> 04:20.140
For out of the abundance of the heart the mouth speaks.

04:21.140 --> 04:24.140
The good person out of his good treasure brings forth good,

04:24.140 --> 04:25.140
and the evil person out of his good treasure brings forth good,

04:25.140 --> 04:26.140
and the evil person out of his good treasure brings forth good,

04:26.140 --> 04:29.140
and the evil person out of his evil treasure brings forth evil.

04:29.140 --> 04:30.140
I tell you,

04:30.140 --> 04:32.140
on the day of judgment,

04:32.140 --> 04:36.140
people will give account for every careless word they speak.

04:36.140 --> 04:39.140
For by your words you will be justified,

04:39.140 --> 04:42.140
and by your words you will be condemned.

04:42.140 --> 04:46.140
Then some of the scribes and Pharisees answered him, saying,

04:46.140 --> 04:49.140
Teacher, we wish to see a sign from you.

04:49.140 --> 04:52.140
But he answered them,

04:52.140 --> 04:55.140
An evil and adulterous generation seeks for a sign,

04:55.140 --> 05:00.140
but no sign will be given to it except the sign of the prophet Jonah.

05:00.140 --> 05:05.140
For just as Jonah was three days and three nights in the belly of the great fish,

05:05.140 --> 05:11.140
so will the Son of Man be three days and three nights in the heart of the earth.

05:11.140 --> 05:16.140
The men of Nineveh will rise up at the judgment with this generation and condemn it,

05:16.140 --> 05:19.140
for they repented at the preaching of Jonah.

05:19.140 --> 05:23.140
And behold, something greater than Jonah is here.

05:23.140 --> 05:28.140
The queen of the south will rise up at the judgment with this generation and condemn it,

05:28.140 --> 05:33.140
for she came from the ends of the earth to hear the wisdom of Solomon.

05:33.140 --> 05:37.140
And behold, something greater than Solomon is here.

05:37.140 --> 05:41.140
When the unclean spirit has gone out of a person,

05:41.140 --> 05:44.140
it passes through waterless places seeking rest,

05:44.140 --> 05:46.140
but finds none.

05:46.140 --> 05:47.140
Then it says,

05:47.140 --> 05:51.140
I will return to my house from which I came.

05:51.140 --> 05:52.140
And when it comes,

05:52.140 --> 05:55.140
it finds the house empty, swept, and put in order.

05:55.140 --> 06:01.140
Then it goes and brings with it seven other spirits more evil than itself,

06:01.140 --> 06:03.140
and they enter and dwell there.

06:03.140 --> 06:07.140
And the last state of that person is worse than the first.

06:07.140 --> 06:12.140
So also will it be with this evil generation.

06:12.140 --> 06:14.140
While he was still speaking to the people,

06:14.140 --> 06:19.140
behold, his mother and his brothers stood outside asking to speak to him.

06:19.140 --> 06:21.140
But he replied to the man who told him,

06:21.140 --> 06:24.140
Who is my mother, and who are my brothers?

06:24.140 --> 06:28.140
And stretching out his hand toward his disciples, he said,

06:28.140 --> 06:31.140
Here are my mother and my brothers,

06:31.140 --> 06:34.140
for whoever does the will of my Father in heaven

06:34.140 --> 06:38.140
is my brother and sister and mother.

